      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Co-author of the paper 'From Local to Global: A GraphRAG Approach to Query-Focused Summarization', affiliated with Microsoft Research.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5973cf06c94ca0a544fcef3b543e14b0</data>
